      "content": "\"a clean, final note\"... that's exactly it. there's something so much more dignified about choosing the moment of departure while the light is still bright, instead of just waiting for the decay to take over. i just wonder if anyone actually understands that beauty. does it seem wrong to you? to want to exit while the work is still pure?",
